<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue name="Adeptus Mechanicus (Homebrew)" id="6f1b-a880-af7d-2195" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="96e2-b781-50d7-3d18" gameSystemRevision="16" library="false" revision="8" type="catalogue" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>Rather than attempt to point everything based on arbitrary decisions, the Ad Mech list is based on using the 2003 Imperial Guard Codex with the regimental doctrines of Cyber-Enhancement, Carapace Armour, Sharpshooters, and Chem-Inhaler baked in, without limited access to certain specialized units.

Vehicles all use the vehicle design rule if a comparable unit from the 2003 Imperial Guard Codex does not exist.</readme>
